      "comment": "LAMIA NONNA MIM (1) recorded her 10th career win last time out (33.10) at Traralgon and drawn box 1 for the first time here. Form here sound including three wins. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. In top form and looks a key chance again. AVENGEMENT (4) ran good time (34.22) when second last start over 595m at this track, the second placing in a row. Key player on best and worth another try. POWER SQUEEZE (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Q Parklands over 710m behind Miss Envy (41.88) in a OPEN. Was in the money prior to that. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Worth another chance. ULENTA BALE (2) must be respected at her pet track and distance.",
